Name pp_macro; Partno PP_MACRO; Revision 01; Date 01/01/26; Designer test; Company test; Assembly x; Location x;
Device g22v10;
$MACRO DEC2 out sel en
out0 = !sel1 & !sel0 & en;
out1 = !sel1 & sel0 & en;
out2 = sel1 & !sel0 & en;
out3 = sel1 & sel0 & en;
$MEND
pin [2..3] = [s0..1];
pin 4 = g;
pin [20..23] = [d0..3];
DEC2(d, s, g);
